A deny no longer waits while a path of its held item carries the restoring
mark: the Restoring branch of the deny arm of FolderState::unsettled, added by
f6cff50 (Queue deny and revert until the folder settles), is removed, so only
a commit in flight at one of its paths still holds the deny. DESIGN.md §8.3,
"deny and revert act only on a settled folder".

